            "created_at": "2025-07-10T21:28:45.33848+00:00",
            "notes": "For the power, you will want to purchase  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) as this is the key power to this build. This allows your beam to automatically heal and damage boost allies, so that you can go Battle Mercy Mode!\n\nThis rounds items, you'll be wanting to purchase the [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) and you might need to sell  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a). \n\nIf you have enough for [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) and the three blues, perfect, if not purchase the [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) as well as  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) if you have a bit of money left over.",
